<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11054" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-vulnĕro</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-voln-</span></b> ), āvi,
			ātum, 1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. a., to wound severety</i> (post-Aug.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eo magis convolneraberis et confodieris, quia
					nescis praebere jugulum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Tranq. 11, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. Pan. 35, 3</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jumenta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt. 5, 13, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">os (apes),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 36, 54, § 129</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gemmam vitis falce,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					4, 24, 18</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Just. 2, 6 <i>fin.</i></span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fistulas,</span>”
				<i>to perforate</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Front. Aquaed. 27</span></i>
			 and 115.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">maledicta mores et vitam convulnerantia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Const. 17, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">convulneratus libidinibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Contr. 2, 9, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
